sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 3: Test System notifies the CSMS about the status change of the connector<br>with StatusNotificationRequest or NotifyEventRequest
    alt StatusNotification
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Occupied)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    else NotifyEvent
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Occupied, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Started, triggerReason = ChargingStateChanged, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>, evse.id = <Configured evseId>, evse.connectorId = <Configured connectorId>, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
